@startuml
autonumber
actor "Gym User" as User
participant ":System" as System

activate User
User -> System : openProfileScreen()
activate System

note right of System: Retrieves logged-in user email\nfrom persistent storage.

System --> User : displays Profile screen with email and Back / Logout options

alt Clicks Back
    User -> System : clickBack()
    System --> User : returns to previous screen
else Clicks Logout
    User -> System : clickLogout()
    System --> User : clears user session and redirects to Login screen
end

deactivate System
deactivate User
@enduml
